  Blurb: Commands fire, frost and storm, and is rarely careful about which.
  Vision:
    Fantasy: 'An elemental mage. Added 2026-10-04: once the Tinkerer is redefined
      as gadgets, nobody else teaches the elemental spells.'
    Role: Intelligence caster dealing elemental damage (fire, ice, lightning) and
      exploiting weaknesses.
    SignatureMechanic: 
    UltraStyle: 
    Ultras: []
    Branches: []
    Overlaps: 
    OpenQuestions: 'Bare minimum: no grid, not on the party roster, no unlock source.
      Inherits the elemental spells the Tinkerer''s grid teaches today: Lightning
      Bolt, Ice Shard, Water Splash, Fireball - and the Storm/Fire/Frost Cloaks (or
      do those stay with the Tinkerer as field kit?). Working name ''Mage''. Stats
      are placeholders.'
